.TH ORO-MCP 3 "" "Oro Runtime" "Oro Runtime API Manual"
.SH NAME
oro:mcp \- JavaScript API module
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
import * as module from 'oro:mcp'
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
Runtime MCP helpers for registering tools/resources and controlling the native HTTP/SSE bridge.
.SH REFERENCE
.TP
